{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Untold Winter is a first person shooter set in a dark fantasy world where a never ending winter fell upon the world. Use powerful firearms, dash, parry and cast magical spells to defeat the terrors of this wintry world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>Combat - Magic and Firearms</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459610/extras/gif1_600x250.gif?t=1745180962\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Even while holding guns you still can cast spells. Combine your firearms with magic: stop time itself with your rifle ammunition or electrify your enemies in place. Parry, dash, cast spells and shoot your way through. Choose between a slow but precise bolt-action rifle, a fast firing machine gun, a powerful shotgun ideal for closed-ranged combat or your loyal 6-chambered revolver. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Spell Casting - Magic Only Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459610/extras/fireball_gif.gif?t=1745180962\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Magic only combat: find Scrolls of Knowledge, invest your points to increase your magic affinity and cast fireballs, lightning bolts, shockwaves, warp time itself with your bare hands, grab and thrown enemies into the air or on each other.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459610/extras/boss-gif.gif?t=1745180962\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face powerful unique enemies that haunt the world. Defeat and cleanse the world from these horrors. Bosses and tougher enemies must be dealt with care, skill and planning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>World Lore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459610/extras/lore.gif?t=1745180962\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Winter King has bought an endless cold upon the world, where all things dead have arisen. His army of all cold creatures and himself march south to conquer the known world. Can you bring this eternal night to an end?\u00a0 \u00a0  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3459610?t=1745180962","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3459610?t=1745180962","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459610/91e346160771050d123ea2a3a40e0bb9f95f2ff9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745180962","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459610/91e346160771050d123ea2a3a40e0bb9f95f2ff9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745180962","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contains violence, firearms and decapitation."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Untold Winter is a first person shooter set in a dark fantasy world where a never ending winter fell upon the world. Use powerful firearms, dash, parry and cast magical spells to defeat the terrors of this wintry world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>Combat - Magic and Firearms</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459610/extras/gif1_600x250.gif?t=1745180962\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Even while holding guns you still can cast spells. Combine your firearms with magic: stop time itself with your rifle ammunition or electrify your enemies in place. Parry, dash, cast spells and shoot your way through. Choose between a slow but precise bolt-action rifle, a fast firing machine gun, a powerful shotgun ideal for closed-ranged combat or your loyal 